---
import '@astrojs/starlight/style/markdown.css';
---

{/*
  Pointer to the docs index for AI agents. Agents that ask mezo.org for
  markdown (Accept: text/markdown) get a copy Cloudflare converts from this
  HTML, not the generated .md files, and the conversion keeps only the page
  content, so the pointer has to live here. It is visually hidden, which the
  conversion keeps, and is plain text rather than a link so keyboard users
  never tab to an invisible link. People get the llms.txt link in the footer.
*/}
<div class="sl-markdown-content">
	<p class="sr-only">For AI agents, the full documentation index is at https://mezo.org/docs/llms.txt.</p>
	<slot />
</div>
